          "da_id": "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.378",
          "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
          "text": "and I have to write very fast to make the minich min minutes .",
          "participant": "MTD021PM",
          "role": "PM"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.203",
          "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
          "text": "Alright .",
          "participant": "MTD022ID",
          "role": "ID"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.377",
          "participant": "MTD021PM",
          "role": "PM",
          "text": "and then we can work for thirty minutes ,"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.426",
          "participant": "MTD024ME",
          "role": "ME",
          "text": "Yeah ."
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.379",
          "participant": "MTD021PM",
          "role": "PM",
          "text": "And then uh we'll see <disfmarker>"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.204",
          "participant": "MTD022ID",
          "role": "ID",
          "text": "How m how long is the lunchbreak ?"
        }
      ],
      "peer_items": [
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#0",
          "type": "actions",
          "text": "The User Interface Designer can design a menu for all these functions."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#1",
          "type": "problems",
          "text": "The current look-and-feel and usability of remote controls are disliked by users and are hard to learn, with remotes often getting lost in rooms."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#2",
          "type": "problems",
          "text": "Open problem: it is unclear what the screen should do or what is required from it."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#3",
          "type": "problems",
          "text": "Uncertainty about saving the project file (whether it saves automatically and where)."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#4",
          "type": "decisions",
          "text": "The target group will be sixteen to forty."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#5",
          "type": "decisions",
          "text": "The basic new requirements of the management were no teletext, only for T_V_."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#6",
          "type": "decisions",
          "text": "Teletext and the newsflash feature will not be used in the future."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#7",
          "type": "decisions",
          "text": "Keep all classic remote functions and improve button usability and the physical design."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#8",
          "type": "decisions",
          "text": "The product must include corporate identity with the logo present and colours consistent."
        }
      ],
